<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">As of the Closing Date and upon completion of
the Business Combination, PubCo had approximately 64,334,789 shares of PubCo Common Stock issued and outstanding, consisting of approximately
33,689,050 shares of PubCo Class A Ordinary Common Stock and 30,645,739 shares of PubCo Class B Super Common Stock, and no shares of preferred
stock outstanding. In addition, as of the Closing Date, PubCo had 14,099,992 PubCo Warrants outstanding, each whole PubCo Warrant entitling
the holder to purchase one share of PubCo Class A Ordinary Common Stock at an exercise price of $11.50 per share.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</p>

